// EXPECT: error
// EXPECT-ERROR-CONTAINS: trait requirement `make` has no receiver — add `&self`/`&var self`, or declare it `static func` if a static was intended
//
// Design 236, position-matrix row 3: a TRAIT requirement. A requirement is
// what every conformer promises, so its kind is the part a reader most needs
// stated — `Deserialize.deserialize` was static from design 169 and could say
// so only in prose. The same funnel serves this position as serves an
// extension method; only the noun in the message differs.

trait Maker {
    func make(seed: Int) -> Self
}

func main() { print("unreached") }
